==============================================================================
PART 2: Constructive centering.  meas(T_w(1/14) cap G_C) and centering SLACK
==============================================================================
T_w(h) = {||w tau|| >= h} (safe band of w).  G_C = gap-1/14 lonely set of core C.
If T_w(1/14) cap G_C is nonempty, ANY tau there is a survivor => M(S)>=1/14.
CENTERED max = max_{tau in G_C} ||w tau||  (how 'middle' we can push w while
staying lonely for the core). SLACK = CENTERED max - 1/14.

