==============================================================================
PART 3b: The m=1 optimum tau*=37/89 vs w=84 band geometry
==============================================================================
  tau* = 37/89 ~ 0.415730
  ||84 tau*|| = 7/89 ~ 0.078652   frac(84 tau*) = 82/89 ~ 0.921348
  nearest 84-band CENTER below/above tau*:
    center j=34: tau=23/56 ~0.410714, distance to tau* = 25/4984 ~0.005016
    center j=35: tau=71/168 ~0.422619, distance to tau* = 103/14952 ~0.006889
  => at the optimum, w=84 is at frac 0.9213, i.e. ||.||=0.0787=M, hugging the EDGE of section 0 (NOT the 1/2 middle).
